                        <p class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] theme-text-muted mt-1 flex items-center gap-1">
                            <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> Data ditarik otomatis dari sheet REKAPITULASI PEMBATALAN (Limitasi max baris 97).
                        </p>
